rainians have asked for there are  three NATO allies with these planes uh  in addition to Poland Slovakia and  Bulgaria also have them and the Polish  government in this announcement that it  was willing to hand over its Fleet also  called on other NATO allies to do the  same  now if a NATO country supplies Ukraine  with fighter jets to shoot down Russian  planes won't Russia see this as a clear  Act of War  I wouldn't doubt that that's what Russia  would call it but of course it has seen  virtually everything as a provocation  NATO simply taking in new members from  Eastern Europe is a provocation Ukraine  existing as as an independent country as  a provocation I think that the Russian  government would say anything being done  to help Ukraine fight back is a  provocation at the same time the west  and NATO have said that Ukraine deserves  the right and the equipment to defend  itself it's been heartbreaking for  everyone to watch what's happening to  Ukraine even as NATO decides not to step  in itself  our correspondent Terry Schultz thank  you so much for joining us with that  update
 

